WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.800
To save a YouTube or Instagram link,
long-press it, tap ⋮ and Copy.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:14.600
In Linkalia, tap + and “Add link”.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:21.400
Tap the URL field:
the keyboard offers to paste the link.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.400
Pick the category and tap Save.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.533
The video's title and image
appear on their own.

